  "_source": "What each gate row is for. Keyed exactly like scripts/lint_coverage.py::COVERAGE (one entry per gate_profiles.ROWS id), plus a `reported` block for ids a module emits without a profile row. Tier 1 is a fault regardless of genre, tier 2 is a judgement that depends on what the piece is, tier 3 informs a mixing or mastering decision and never blocks. tests/test_gate_tiers.py reads this file; scripts/gate_tiers.py is the only reader in the gate.",
